# Sensitive Bridge v1.4 PII Redaction

## Rule

Every Sensitive Bridge alert payload passed to `coach_notifications.notify_coach()` must first pass through `pii_redaction.redact_pii()`.

## Preserve

Hotline numbers and resource URLs must not be redacted. Examples include `1-888-373-7888` and crisis/resource links.

## Storage Boundary

Redacted content goes to coach-facing notifications. Unredacted clinical/audit context may only remain in `sensitive_bridge_log` under clinician-only access controls.

## Failure

PII redaction hard failures must be visible in logs and must not silently drop the alert. Use a redaction-failed placeholder for the coach payload if needed.
